		<text x="475" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5">…</text>
		<text x="535" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">0.36</text>

		<defs>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-emb1" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#7c3aed"/>
			</marker>
		</defs>
		<line x1="700" y1="174" x2="585" y2="174" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-emb1)"/>
		<text x="785" y="170" text-anchor="end" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="600">embedding</text>
		<text x="785" y="187" text-anchor="end" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="600">for "strawberry"</text>

		<text x="400" y="280" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">matrix shape: <tspan font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-weight="600" opacity="1">vocab_size × embedding_dim</tspan></text>
		<text x="400" y="298" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55" font-style="italic">typically 30k to 100k rows by 512 to 4096 columns</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>The embedding matrix. Every token in the vocabulary gets one row. To embed a token with ID 73,700, look up row 73,700 and read out the dense vector. That is the entire operation, and it is the first thing the model does on any input.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cw-illus { margin: 1.75rem auto; max-width: 100%; }
